1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,721
Every indicator has its own range.

2
00:00:02,721 --> 00:00:08,580
Methyl orange changes between three point one and four point four, red to yellow.

3
00:00:08,580 --> 00:00:14,531
Methyl red, litmus, bromothymol blue and phenol red sit in the middle.

4
00:00:14,531 --> 00:00:20,195
Phenolphthalein changes between eight point three and ten, colourless to pink.

